<div class="meta-box">
  <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0284c7; margin-bottom: 2pt;">ORCA: Marine Ecosystem Reasoning Platform</div>
  <div style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 6pt;">Comprehensive End-to-End System Workflow & Architecture Document</div>
  <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b;">
    <strong>Scope:</strong> Frontend (React 19) &bull; Backend (FastAPI) &bull; Database (Supabase PostgreSQL) &bull; 7-Stage Multi-Agent AI Engine<br/>
    <strong>Hackathon:</strong> Smart India Hackathon (SIH 2026) &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Problem Statement:</strong> PS-26176
  </div>
