<h2>5. Supabase PostgreSQL Database Architecture</h2>

<p>Our cloud database schema (<code>supabase_schema.sql</code>) guarantees ACID transaction guarantees and Row Level Security (RLS):</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 22%;">Table Name</th>
      <th style="width: 28%;">Primary Keys & Foreign Keys</th>
      <th style="width: 50%;">Stored Attributes & Purpose</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.users</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY &rarr; auth.users(id)</code></td>
      <td>Stores user email, role (<code>user</code>, <code>researcher</code>, <code>admin</code>), full name, and syncs automatically with Supabase Auth via triggers.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.ocean_observations</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY</code></td>
      <td>Satellite SST (&deg;C), Chlorophyll-a (mg/m&sup3;), salinity (PSU), observation timestamp, and institutional source.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.wave_observations</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY</code></td>
      <td>Significant wave height ($H_s$ in meters), swell period, wave direction, and buoy source (INCOIS).</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.alerts</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY</code></td>
      <td>Hazard title, severity enum (<code>LOW</code>, <code>MODERATE</code>, <code>HIGH</code>, <code>CRITICAL</code>), coordinates, and advisory text.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.conversations</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY</code></td>
      <td>User-isolated chat sessions with titles and timestamps for multi-tab persistent conversation drawers.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>public.chat_messages</code></td>
      <td><code>id UUID PRIMARY KEY &rarr; conversations(id)</code></td>
      <td>Individual message turns, sender (<code>user</code>/<code>orca</code>), message text, language, route flags, and structured JSON telemetry.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

