<h2>6. Mathematical Formulations & Deterministic Engines</h2>

<h3>6.1. Haversine Great-Circle Geodesic Distance</h3>
<div class="formula-box">
  &Delta;&phi; = &phi;<sub>2</sub> &minus; &phi;<sub>1</sub>, &nbsp;&nbsp; &Delta;&lambda; = &lambda;<sub>2</sub> &minus; &lambda;<sub>1</sub><br/>
  <strong>a</strong> = sin&sup2;(&Delta;&phi; / 2) + cos(&phi;<sub>1</sub>) &times; cos(&phi;<sub>2</sub>) &times; sin&sup2;(&Delta;&lambda; / 2)<br/>
  <strong>c</strong> = 2 &times; atan2(&radic;a, &radic;(1 &minus; a))<br/>
  <strong>Distance (d)</strong> = R &times; c &nbsp;&nbsp; <em>(where R = 6,371.0 km)</em>
</div>

<h3>6.2. True Compass Bearing</h3>
<div class="formula-box">
  x = sin(&Delta;&lambda;) &times; cos(&phi;<sub>2</sub>)<br/>
  y = cos(&phi;<sub>1</sub>) &times; sin(&phi;<sub>2</sub>) &minus; sin(&phi;<sub>1</sub>) &times; cos(&phi;<sub>2</sub>) &times; cos(&Delta;&lambda;)<br/>
  <strong>Heading (&theta;)</strong> = (degrees(atan2(x, y)) + 360) mod 360
</div>

<h3>6.3. Deterministic 5-Factor Maritime Risk Formula (0–100)</h3>
<div class="formula-box">
  <strong>Risk (R) = 0.30(R<sub>wave</sub>) + 0.20(R<sub>wind</sub>) + 0.30(R<sub>hazard</sub>) + 0.10(R<sub>dist</sub>) + 0.10(R<sub>geofence</sub>)</strong><br/>
  &bull; <strong>R<sub>wave</sub>:</strong> Wave height scale (Hs &lt; 0.8m: 10 | 0.8-1.5m: 25 | 1.5-2.2m: 55 | 2.2-3.2m: 85 | &gt;3.2m: 100)<br/>
  &bull; <strong>R<sub>wind</sub>:</strong> Wind velocity scale (&lt;15 km/h: 10 | 15-25 km/h: 30 | 25-40 km/h: 65 | &gt;40 km/h: 100) + Squall penalty<br/>
  &bull; <strong>R<sub>hazard</sub>:</strong> Max severity alert (LOW: 30 | MODERATE: 60 | HIGH: 85 | SEVERE: 100)<br/>
  &bull; <strong>R<sub>dist</sub>:</strong> Normalized trip duration and distance<br/>
  &bull; <strong>R<sub>geofence</sub>:</strong> CLEAR: 0 | NEAR BOUNDARY: 40 | INTERSECTS: 100 (Hard Block)
</div>

<div class="callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-title">HARD SAFETY OVERRIDE RULES</div>
  <p>If Significant Wave Height &ge; 2.4m OR Sustained Wind &ge; 42 km/h OR Critical Hazard &ge; 85:<br/>
  <strong>Total Risk = max(R, 65.0) &rarr; Forces HIGH RISK Band and small craft advisory override.</strong></p>
</div>

<h3>6.4. Composite Fishing Suitability Index (0–100)</h3>
<div class="formula-box">
  <strong>Suitability (S) = 0.35(S<sub>PFZ</sub>) + 0.20(S<sub>Wave</sub>) + 0.20(S<sub>Weather</sub>) + 0.10(S<sub>Hazard</sub>) + 0.10(S<sub>Ocean</sub>) + 0.05(S<sub>Tide</sub>)</strong>
</div>

