<h2>7. Offline Resilience & Fault-Tolerance Matrix</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Failure Scenario</th>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Primary Component</th>
      <th style="width: 50%;">Automated Fault-Tolerance Mechanism</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Gemini LLM API Offline / Rate Limited</strong></td>
      <td><code>llm_client.py</code></td>
      <td>Catches network timeout and switches automatically to an embedded local rule-based Markdown synthesis engine. Zero app crashes.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Cloud Supabase Database Unreachable</strong></td>
      <td><code>supabase_client.py</code> & <code>api.js</code></td>
      <td>Fails over to browser <code>localStorage</code> and Python local coastal benchmark registry (<code>indian_coastal_registry.py</code>).</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>GPS Satellite Signal Denied / Inland Location</strong></td>
      <td><code>nlu_agent.py</code> & <code>App.jsx</code></td>
      <td>Detects inland coordinate, displays advisory banner, and automatically routes passage from the nearest coastal fishery hub.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>GIS C-Libraries (Shapely) Missing</strong></td>
      <td><code>gis_agent.py</code></td>
      <td>Falls back to our pure-Python Jordan Curve ray-casting algorithm for 2D point-in-polygon boundary validation.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

